{"strongs": "H7186", "word": "קָשֶׁה", "translit": "qa.sheh", "root": "קשא", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "hard, severe", "definition": "קָשֶׁה adjective hard, severe ; — absolute ׳ ק Exod 18:26 +; construct Exod 32:9 +; feminine singular קָשָׁה Deut 26:6 +; construct קְשַׁת 1Sam 1:15 masculine plural קָשִׁים 2Sam 3:39 construct קְשֵׁי Ezek 2:4 ; Ezek 3:7 feminine plural קָשׁוֺת Gen 42:7 ; Gen 42:30 — 1. hard, difficult , of a legal question ( דָּבָר ) Exod 18:26 ( E ). 2. a. severe , of battle 2Sam 2:17 , wind Isa 27:8 , servitude ( עֲבֹדָה ) 1Kgs 12:4 = 2Chr 10:4 ; Deut 26:6 ; Isa 14:3 ; Exod 1:14 ; Exod 6:9 (both P ); as n.collective הִרְאִיתָ עַמְּךָ קָשָׁה Ps 60:5 thou hast made thy people see severe things ; קְשֵׁה יוֺם Job 30:25 i.e. one whose time (life) is hard, so 1Sam 1:15 (reading קְשַׁת יוֺם for רוּחַ ׳ ק , ᵐ5 Th We Dr and others); severe, rough , of lord ( אֲדֹנִים ) Isa 19:4 , compare 2Sam 3:39 (with מִן compare [ מִמֶּנּוּ ? see HPS ]); הָלוֺח וְקָשָׁה עַלֿ Judg 4:24 the hand of the sons of Israel went on being more and more severe upon Jabin; fierce, relentless , of ׳ י 's sword Isa 27:1 (in figurative); rough, rude 1Sam 25:3 severe things , of language Gen 42:7 ; Gen 42:30 ( E ; with דִּדֶּר ), 1Sam 20:10 ; 1Kgs 12:13 = 2Chr 10:13 (all with עָנָה ); וְאָנֹכִי שָׁלוּחַ אֵלַיִח קָשָׁה 1Kgs 14:6 I am commissioned with a severe (message) unto thee ( Ges «GKC:121d»§ 121d . N.2 Da Synt. §§ 75 (d), 80); חָזוּת קָשָׁה Isa 21:2 . \\ \\ b. fierce, intense, vehement , of קִנְאָה Song 8:6 (|| עַזָּה ; compare Gen 49:9 ). 3. עַםקְֿשֵׁהעֹֿרֶף a people stiff of neck, stubborn , Exod 32:9 ; Exod 33:3 ; Exod 33:5 ; Exod 34:9 (all J E ), Deut 9:6 ; Deut 9:13 עָרְפְּךָ הַקָּשֶׁה Deut 31:27 compare דַּרְכָּם הַקָּשָׁה Judg 2:19 קְשֵׁי פָנִים Ezek 2:4 (+ חִזְקֵילֵֿב ), קְשֵׁאלֵֿב Ezek 3:7 (+ חִזְקֵימְֿצַח ); ׳ ק alone = stubborn Isa 48:4 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7636')\">BDB7636</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7186')\">H7186</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7635')\">BDB7635</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7637')\">BDB7637</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קָשֶׁה</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>hard, severe</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 18:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,26)\">Exod 18:26</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Exod 32:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,9)\">Exod 32:9</ref> +; feminine singular <bdbheb>קָשָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 26:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,6)\">Deut 26:6</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>קְשַׁת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,15)\">1Sam 1:15</ref> masculine plural <bdbheb>קָשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:39\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,39)\">2Sam 3:39</ref> construct <bdbheb>קְשֵׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 2:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,2,4)\">Ezek 2:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 3:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,3,7)\">Ezek 3:7</ref> feminine plural <bdbheb>קָשׁוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 42:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,7)\">Gen 42:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 42:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,30)\">Gen 42:30</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>hard, difficult</highlight>, of a legal question (<bdbheb>דָּבָר</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Exod 18:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,26)\">Exod 18:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. a.</b> <highlight>severe</highlight>, of battle <ref ref=\"2Sam 2:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,2,17)\">2Sam 2:17</ref>, wind <ref ref=\"Isa 27:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,8)\">Isa 27:8</ref>, servitude (<bdbheb>עֲבֹדָה</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,4)\">1Kgs 12:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 10:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,10,4)\">2Chr 10:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 26:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,6)\">Deut 26:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 14:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,3)\">Isa 14:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 1:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,1,14)\">Exod 1:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 6:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,6,9)\">Exod 6:9</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); as n.collective <bdbheb>הִרְאִיתָ עַמְּךָ קָשָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,5)\">Ps 60:5</ref> <highlight>thou hast made thy people see severe things</highlight>; <bdbheb>קְשֵׁה יוֺם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 30:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,25)\">Job 30:25</ref> i.e. one whose time (life) is hard, so <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,15)\">1Sam 1:15</ref> (reading <bdbheb>קְשַׁת יוֺם</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>רוּחַ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> and others); <highlight>severe, rough</highlight>, of lord (<bdbheb>אֲדֹנִים</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Isa 19:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,4)\">Isa 19:4</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:39\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,39)\">2Sam 3:39</ref> (with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> compare [<bdbheb>מִמֶּנּוּ</bdbheb>? see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup>]); <bdbheb>הָלוֺח וְקָשָׁה עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 4:24\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,24)\">Judg 4:24</ref> the hand of the sons of Israel went on <highlight>being more and more severe</highlight> upon Jabin; <highlight>fierce, relentless</highlight>, of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s sword <ref ref=\"Isa 27:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,1)\">Isa 27:1</ref> (in figurative); <highlight>rough, rude</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,3)\">1Sam 25:3</ref> <highlight>severe things</highlight>, of language <ref ref=\"Gen 42:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,7)\">Gen 42:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 42:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,30)\">Gen 42:30</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; with <bdbheb>דִּדֶּר</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,10)\">1Sam 20:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,13)\">1Kgs 12:13</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 10:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,10,13)\">2Chr 10:13</ref> (all with <bdbheb>עָנָה</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>וְאָנֹכִי שָׁלוּחַ אֵלַיִח קָשָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,6)\">1Kgs 14:6</ref> <highlight>I am commissioned with a severe (message) unto thee</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:121d»§ 121d</sup>. N.2 <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Da')\">Da<sup>Synt. §§ 75</sup></lookup> (d), 80); <bdbheb>חָזוּת קָשָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 21:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,21,2)\">Isa 21:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>fierce, intense, vehement</highlight>, of <bdbheb>קִנְאָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 8:6\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,6)\">Song 8:6</ref> (|| <bdbheb>עַזָּה</bdbheb>; compare <ref ref=\"Gen 49:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,9)\">Gen 49:9</ref>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>עַםקְֿשֵׁהעֹֿרֶף</bdbheb> <highlight>a people stiff of neck, stubborn</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Exod 32:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,9)\">Exod 32:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 33:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,33,3)\">Exod 33:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 33:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,33,5)\">Exod 33:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 34:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,9)\">Exod 34:9</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 9:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,6)\">Deut 9:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 9:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,13)\">Deut 9:13</ref> <bdbheb>עָרְפְּךָ הַקָּשֶׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 31:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,27)\">Deut 31:27</ref> compare <bdbheb>דַּרְכָ